                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرٌ وَارِقٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Trees having leaves:</i> (Msb:) [or
<i>leafy trees; trees having many leaves;</i> for]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرَةٌ وَارِقَةٌ</span> (TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرِقَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرِيقَةٌ</span></b>  (S,
K, TA) signify <i>a tree having many leaves.</i>
(S, K, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرَةٌ وَارِقَةُ الظِّلَالِ</span> [<i>A tree
having leafy coverings</i> or <i>shades</i>]. (K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غيل</span>.)

